{{Term/Store|Hearty Salmon|Hearty Salmons|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s and [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Hearty Salmon}}
Hearty Salmons inhabit cold bodies of [[Water (Terrain)|Water]] within the [[Hebra Mountains]] and the [[Tabantha Frontier]]. Their bodies accrete layers of fat in response to this, insulating them from their cold surroundings.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Eating them raw restores four [[Heart]]s to [[Link]]'s [[Life Gauge]]. Exposed to fire, Hearty Salmons become [[Roasted Hearty Salmon]]s. Alternatively, they can be exposed to [[Ice]] to become [[Frozen Hearty Salmon]]. [[Meal]]s made using Hearty Salmons will grant Link [[Extra Hearts]] when eaten.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

During the [[Shrine Quest]] "[[Recital at Warbler's Nest]]", [[Kotts]] can be found fishing for Hearty Salmon at the [[Fishpond in Front of the Village]].<ref name="BotW Kotts"/> When reminded of the recital, she will give Link a Hearty Salmon for [[Genli]].<ref name="BotW Kotts 2"/>

